  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ガラナツのえだを　あみこんだ　ブレスレット。\nガラルちほうの　ヤドンに\nつけてあげると　よろこぶ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "가라두구가지를 엮어서 만든 팔찌.\n가라르지방의 야돈에게 채워주면 기뻐한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用伽勒荳蔻枝編成的手環。\n幫伽勒爾地區的呆呆獸戴上，\n牠就會很高興。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un bracelet confectionné à partir de Branches Galanoa.\nLes Ramoloss de Galar adorent en porter.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Armreif, der aus Galarnuss-Zweigen gewoben wird.\nGalar-Flegmon freuen sich, wenn sie diesen anlegen\ndürfen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un brazalete hecho de Ramas de Galanuez trenzadas.\nLos Slowpoke de Galar se ponen contentísimos si lo\nreciben como regalo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un bracciale ottenuto intrecciando Rami Galarnoce.\nGli Slowpoke di Galar amano indossarlo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A cuff made from woven-together Galarica Twigs.\nGiving it to Galarian Slowpoke makes the\nPokémon very happy.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ガラナツのえだを　編み込んだ　ブレスレット。\nガラル地方の　ヤドンに\nつけてあげると　喜ぶ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用伽勒豆蔻枝编织的手环。\n给伽勒尔地区的呆呆兽戴上，\n它就会很开心。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
